Scope and attribution to third parties
--------------------------------------

The index is a compilation of facts (driver versions, release dates, hardware
IDs, file hashes, download URLs) derived from the public support pages and
update catalogues of the hardware and silicon vendors it covers. This license
covers only the compilation and the values computed from it (water level,
vendor lag, family assignment). It grants no rights in:

  - the driver packages themselves, which this project never redistributes
    (download URLs point at the vendors' own servers and remain subject to
    each vendor's EULA);
  - vendor, product and brand names, which belong to their owners and are
    used here only to identify the products the data describes.

The data is provided as-is. "Water level" is the newest version any vendor has
published, not a judgement that it is good; see the `caveat` field carried in
each published file.

Citing a stable snapshot
------------------------

`/v1/latest/` changes on every refresh. For a reproducible citation, pin the
dated snapshot the file was taken from, `/v1/{YYYY-MM-DD}/…`, and record the
`schema_version` and `license` fields carried at the top of every file.
